      "widgets_values": [
        "Use <Picture 1> for the first subject identity, <Picture 2> for the second subject identity, <Picture 3> for their physical size relationship, and <Picture 4> for the environment and photographic style. Follow the depth control for the complete duration: camera, spatial layout, subject depth, compact body proportions, movement path, timing and ground contacts. Preserve the skull size, torso length and girth, and limb lengths of each subject throughout movement. Generate natural gait, facial reactions, soft tissue and local contact feedback within the controlled structure. Generate one coherent scene with shared lighting and grounded shadows. Normal real-time motion. No background music, songs, humming, speech, subtitles, rulers, reference-board layouts or labels."
